OL,3,AMan accused of mass train stabbing
OL,4,Aadmits wounding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of a mass stabbing on a
OL,7,Ftrain in Cambridgeshire last year has
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to 12 counts of wounding
OL,9,Fwith intent.
OL,11,FPassengers and staff were injured on
OL,12,Fthe 18:25 Doncaster-London service on
OL,13,FSaturday, 1 November after it left
OL,14,FPeterborough, causing it to make an
OL,15,Funscheduled stop at Huntingdon railway
OL,16,Fstation.
OL,18,FAnthony Williams, 33, has denied 14
OL,19,Fcounts of attempted murder, relating to
OL,20,Fthe train and to incidents in London
OL,21,Fand Peterborough, and is due to stand
OL,22,Ftrial next week.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
