OL,3,AMan accused of mass train stabbing
OL,4,Aadmits wounding
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing at a pre-trial review at
OL,7,FCambridge Crown Court, Williams, of
OL,8,FLangford Road in Peterborough, pleaded
OL,9,Fguilty to the lesser wounding charges
OL,10,Fand several other offences.
